{"title":"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/53100a5b850bede395dcb4369b560d46456c4bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 3^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4ee4dcb0b84a5171672c7a73232f83cbe6a49ed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply evaluate the expression using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55057239212d01c6c127514a32d4992c89ca2eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 3^{2} = 1 + 9 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"203\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/in